-5$ and $x=3,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/da88a1971a7a389c8f5b59ebd3cef2a146eb09113c3e71031bf9dfb6cdbe91e1.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *above* the axis. \n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $-5<x<3.$"}]}
